{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your mind and master the shuffle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic Deck</strong> is a colorful puzzle card game where every move counts. Arrange, stack, and shuffle vibrant decks to solve tricky challenges. Easy to learn but hard to put down, this game is perfect for puzzle lovers who enjoy strategy with a playful twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Dynamic Card Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Match, shuffle, and organize decks in clever ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Bright &amp; Playful Design</strong> \u2013 Enjoy smooth animations and vibrant cartoony visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Brain-Teasing Levels</strong> \u2013 Test your logic with increasingly challenging layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Quick Sessions</strong> \u2013 Perfect for both short breaks and long puzzle marathons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Relaxing yet Strategic</strong> \u2013 Accessible for casual players, rewarding for thinkers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the master of the deck?<br>Jump in and let your logic lead the way!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033020?t=1760478354","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033020?t=1760478354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033020/5b8795b61ddd3e1208b2160d421635581c27cb5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760478354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033020/5b8795b61ddd3e1208b2160d421635581c27cb5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760478354","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors"